  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "画出想法，交给 DSH",
      "text": "[](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/latest) [](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](docs/dsh-compatibility.md) [](LICENSE)\n\n[**安装**](#快速开始) · [**使用指南**](docs/usage.md) · [**更新记录**](docs/release-v0.7.0.md) · [**English**](README.en.md)\n\n</div>\n\n**在 DSH 会话里画草图，让 Agent 读图、讨论并继续实现。** 用 Excalidraw 表达页面布局、PPT 分区或手绘想法；用 Sketch Graph 串联页面与细节。原生聊天、工作区和模型配置继续沿用 DSH。\n\n*总览看关系，双击画细节。分屏与全屏随时切换。[演示素材说明](docs/assets/v0.7.0/README.md)*"
    },
    {
      "section": "从草图到下一步",
      "text": "| 你想做什么 | 在同一个 DSH 会话里继续 |\n| --- | --- |\n| **做一个网页** | 画出布局与跳转关系 → “按这些草图实现页面” → 在工作区运行和调整 |\n| **制作 PPT** | 画出每页的内容分区 → “按这个结构制作可编辑幻灯片” → 继续改指定页 |\n| **讨论某个细节** | 选中元素或查看锚点批注 → 追问、纠正 → 预览并确认画板修改 |\n\n**画板与对话保持接续：** 草图按会话保存，Agent 按需读取结构和 PNG；批注可以定位到图形。根草图的 AI 修改先预览、再确认，旧提议不能覆盖新版本。绘图、移动和查看批注不触发模型请求。\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>看实际案例：4 张草图 → 电商网页</strong></summary>\n\nWindows DSH alpha.2 的真实 DeepSeek 对话读取 4 张草图及关联，生成 HTML/CSS/JS，再经反馈纠正。GIF 展示完成后的网页交互，已剪去等待。[过程、修正与验收记录](docs/validation-v0.7.0.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "从草图到下一步",
      "text": "更多案例：[网页／UI 与 5 页 PPTX](docs/release-readiness-v0.6.0.md#b-真实应用与纠正) · [无文字手绘识别](docs/windows-validation-v0.4.0-20261010.md)\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "预先安装 **DSH Web `0.2.1-alpha.1` 或 `0.2.1-alpha.2`**，并确保 pnpm 可用。无需另装 Excalidraw 或额外配置 AI 密钥。升级前等待草图保存、导出备份并退出正在运行的 DSH。\n\n通过官方插件管理器安装 **[v0.7.0](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/tag/v0.7.0)**：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/download/v0.7.0/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0.tgz\ndsh web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "1. 选择工作区与会话，点击输入框旁的 **「参考板」**，画图并填写用途。\n2. 等待 **「已保存」**，回到原生聊天：“按当前草图制作页面”。也可点 **「作为参考发送」** 添加 PNG 附件。\n3. 继续讨论，或请求批注与修改；检查修改预览后确认，聊天消息由你发送。\n\n**其他安装方式仍然保留：**\n\n<details>\n<summary>下载 TGZ／安装 ZIP，本地加入 DSH</summary>\n\n从 [Release](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/latest) 下载 `.tgz` 和 `SHA256SUMS.txt`；[安装 ZIP](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/download/v0.7.0/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0-installable.zip) 解压后包含相同安装包及校验清单。核验后执行："
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add /绝对路径/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0.tgz\ndsh web\n```\n\n[成功 CI](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/actions/workflows/ci.yml) 的 `dsh-sketch-reference-installable` 产物也保留，供测试尚未发行的改动。\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>源码 ZIP 解压、构建后直接加入 DSH</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "快速开始",
      "text": "下载 [固定 v0.7.0 源码 ZIP](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/archive/refs/tags/v0.7.0.zip)，或使用 [Code → Download ZIP](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/archive/refs/heads/main.zip) 获取最新主分支。解压并进入包含 `package.json` 的目录：\n\n```sh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm run bundle"
    },
    {
      "section": "等待保存并退出 DSH；路径替换为实际解压目录",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add \"/绝对路径/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0\"\ndsh web\n```\n\n无需先打包 TGZ。DSH 链接该目录，请保留目录及 `lib`、`node_modules`；更新源码后重新构建并重启宿主。[Windows 路径与升级说明](docs/installation.md#从源码-zip-目录直接安装)\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch Graph：一张草图，一个节点",
      "text": "- **组织设计。** 用节点命名页面，区分页面跳转和细节展开；从元素、多元素或框选区域连接细节。\n- **保持可编辑。** 双击进入 Excalidraw，沿面包屑返回；旧草图保留为根节点，不覆盖迁移。\n- **按需提供上下文。** Agent 先读图关系和摘要，需要细节时再读指定节点与 PNG。\n- **继续原生工作流。** 自动保存、冲突保护、可编辑备份与添加式恢复；全屏仍可使用原生聊天。\n\n[完整使用指南](docs/usage.md) · [安装与升级](docs/installation.md) · [文档索引](docs/README.md) · [DeepWiki](https://deepwiki.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference)\n\n<details>\n<summary>兼容性、数据与当前边界</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch Graph：一张草图，一个节点",
      "text": "- 社区插件，适配上述两版 DSH Web；其他宿主版本、移动端和全部插件组合未作兼容承诺。模型读取图像需要视觉能力；基础绘图、保存与导出独立可用。\n- 最多 100 节点／300 连线，满载仍可能掉帧。整图撤销、搜索、复杂绑定编辑和跨刷新撤销历史尚未提供；批注、改图提议和原生附件发送目前限根草图。\n- 草稿与图片存储在本地 DSH；被模型读取时发送至已配置服务。历史附件尚无自动回收，升级／卸载前请导出备份。模型可能误读或返回无效参数，无法可靠定位时退回文字建议。\n- 本插件提供可编辑参考和协作工具；网页与 PPT 由 DSH Agent 及其工作区工具实现。选区重点不约束其他宿主工具，也不清除聊天历史。\n\n[本版验证](docs/validation-v0.7.0.md) · [性能与已知限制](docs/review-graph-performance-20261017.md) · [宿主兼容报告](docs/dsh-compatibility.md)。正式包的 Linux 回归与历史 Windows／真实模型案例有各自记录，不等于全平台完整验收。\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "参与改进",
      "text": "觉得有用，欢迎 **[Star](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/stargazers)** 关注更新。带着脱敏草图与复现步骤 [反馈问题](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/issues)，或按 [贡献指南](CONTRIBUTING.md) 提交 PR。\n\n[MIT](LICENSE) · 绘图来自 Excalidraw · 图总览来自 React Flow · [复用说明](REUSE.md) · [第三方许可](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)\n\n[](https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">"
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch it. Let DSH help.",
      "text": "[](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/latest) [](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/actions/workflows/ci.yml) [](docs/dsh-compatibility.md) [](LICENSE)\n\n[**Install**](#quick-start) · [**Usage**](docs/usage.md) · [**Release notes**](docs/release-v0.7.0.md) · [**中文**](README.md)\n\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch it. Let DSH help.",
      "text": "**Draw in your DSH session. Let the Agent read, discuss and build from it.** Use Excalidraw for page layouts, slide outlines or freehand ideas. Connect pages and details with Sketch Graph. Keep DSH’s native chat, workspace and model configuration.\n\n*See relationships in the overview; double-click to draw the details. Switch between split view and fullscreen. [Demo provenance](docs/assets/v0.7.0/README.md)*"
    },
    {
      "section": "From a sketch to the next step",
      "text": "| What you want to do | Continue in the same DSH conversation |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Build a webpage** | Sketch layouts and navigation → ask the Agent to implement → run and refine in the workspace |\n| **Make slides** | Sketch each page’s regions → request editable slides → revise a specific page |\n| **Discuss a detail** | Select shapes or open an anchored comment → ask a follow-up → preview and approve canvas edits |"
    },
    {
      "section": "From a sketch to the next step",
      "text": "**Keep drawing and discussion connected:** sketches are session-bound; the Agent reads structure and PNGs on demand. Comments can point to shapes. AI edits to the root sketch require a preview and approval; stale proposals cannot overwrite a newer drawing. Drawing, moving shapes and viewing comments do not trigger model calls.\n\n<details>\n<summary><strong>Real example: four sketches → an e-commerce website</strong></summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "From a sketch to the next step",
      "text": "Real DeepSeek conversations in Windows DSH alpha.2 read four sketches and their relationships, generated HTML/CSS/JS, then corrected the result through feedback. The GIF shows interactions with the completed site, with waits edited out. [Process, corrections and validation](docs/validation-v0.7.0.md)\n\nMore cases: [Web/UI and a five-page PPTX](docs/release-readiness-v0.6.0.md#b-真实应用与纠正) · [Unlabeled freehand recognition](docs/windows-validation-v0.4.0-20261010.md)\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "Install **DSH Web `0.2.1-alpha.1` or `0.2.1-alpha.2`** first, with pnpm available. No separate Excalidraw installation or extra AI key configuration is needed. Before upgrading, wait for saves, export a backup and exit the running DSH host.\n\nInstall **[v0.7.0](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/tag/v0.7.0)** through the official plugin manager:"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/download/v0.7.0/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0.tgz\ndsh web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "1. Choose a workspace and session. Click **参考板** beside the composer, draw and add a purpose.\n2. Wait for **已保存** and ask in native chat: “Build a webpage from the current sketch.” **作为参考发送** optionally adds the PNG to the composer.\n3. Continue discussing, annotating or requesting changes. Review canvas edits before approval; send chat messages yourself.\n\n**Other installation options remain available:**\n\n<details>\n<summary>Download a TGZ / installable ZIP and add it locally</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "Get the `.tgz` and `SHA256SUMS.txt` from [Releases](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/latest). The [installable ZIP](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/releases/download/v0.7.0/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0-installable.zip) contains the same package and its checksum file. Verify them, then run:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0.tgz\ndsh web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "The `dsh-sketch-reference-installable` artifact in [successful CI runs](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/actions/workflows/ci.yml) remains available for testing unreleased changes.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary>Extract a source ZIP, build and add the project directory</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Quick start",
      "text": "Download the [tagged v0.7.0 source ZIP](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/archive/refs/tags/v0.7.0.zip), or use [Code → Download ZIP](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/archive/refs/heads/main.zip) for the latest main branch. Extract and open the directory containing `package.json`:\n\n```sh\npnpm install --frozen-lockfile\npnpm run bundle"
    },
    {
      "section": "Save and exit DSH; replace the path with your extracted directory",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add \"/absolute/path/dsh-sketch-reference-0.7.0\"\ndsh web\n```\n\nNo TGZ packing is required. DSH links this directory: keep it, including `lib` and `node_modules`. Rebuild and restart after source updates. [Windows paths and upgrades](docs/installation.md#从源码-zip-目录直接安装)\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch Graph: one sketch per node",
      "text": "- **Organize a design.** Name pages and distinguish navigation from detail relationships. Link details from an element, multiple elements or a selected region.\n- **Keep it editable.** Double-click into Excalidraw and return through breadcrumbs. Existing sketches stay as the root document.\n- **Read context on demand.** The Agent reads graph relationships and summaries first, then specific nodes and PNGs as needed.\n- **Continue the native workflow.** Autosave, conflict protection, editable backups and additive recovery; native chat remains available in fullscreen."
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch Graph: one sketch per node",
      "text": "[Usage guide](docs/usage.md) · [Installation and upgrades](docs/installation.md) · [Documentation index](docs/README.md) · [DeepWiki](https://deepwiki.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference)\n\n<details>\n<summary>Compatibility, data and current boundaries</summary>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch Graph: one sketch per node",
      "text": "- A community plugin for the two DSH Web versions above. Other hosts, mobile clients and all plugin combinations are not claimed compatible. Image reads require visual input support; drawing, saving and exports work independently. The plugin UI is Chinese.\n- Up to 100 nodes / 300 edges; full graphs still drop frames. Graph-wide undo, search, complex bound-element edits and undo across refreshes are unavailable. Comments, edit proposals and native attachment sending currently target the root sketch.\n- Drafts and images live in local DSH storage; data read by a model goes to the configured provider. Historical attachments are not automatically reclaimed. Export backups before upgrades or removal. Models may misread sketches or return invalid parameters; uncertain anchors fall back to text.\n- The plugin provides editable references and collaboration tools. Webpages and slides are built by DSH Agent and its workspace tools. Focus does not constrain other host tools or erase chat history."
    },
    {
      "section": "Sketch Graph: one sketch per node",
      "text": "[Version validation](docs/validation-v0.7.0.md) · [Performance and limitations](docs/review-graph-performance-20261017.md) · [Host compatibility](docs/dsh-compatibility.md). Formal-package Linux regressions and historical Windows / real-model cases retain their own evidence; they do not establish complete cross-platform acceptance.\n\n</details>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Contribute",
      "text": "Find it useful? **[Star the repository](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/stargazers)** to follow updates. [Report issues](https://github.com/Amadeus2027/dsh-sketch-reference/issues) with sanitized sketches and reproduction steps, or submit a PR following the [contribution guide](CONTRIBUTING.md).\n\n[MIT](LICENSE) · Drawing by Excalidraw · Graph overview by React Flow · [Reuse](REUSE.md) · [Third-party notices](THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Contribute",
